{
  "statement": "The EfficiencyAgent emphasizes the importance of performance efficiency in the autonomous driving system. Requirement EFF-01 aims for a significant reduction in travel time, enhancing overall system efficiency. EFF-02 ensures passenger comfort by maintaining jerk levels below 0.5 m/s³ during normal operations. EFF-03 focuses on executing Minimal Risk Maneuvers promptly to balance safety and performance. EFF-04 mandates real-time monitoring of ODD compliance with minimal latency, crucial for responsiveness. EFF-05 targets high success rates in speed profile generation, while EFF-06 optimizes processing time for obstacle constraints. Lastly, EFF-07 prioritizes smoothness during emergencies to ensure seamless transitions, albeit with potential trade-offs.",
